---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Consilegy"
  description="Consilegy helps English-speaking leaders in Japan and APAC build revenue operations that work for how Japan actually moves. Learn about the founder and what we believe."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrl="/company/"
>
<script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://consilegy.com/en/"},
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": "https://consilegy.com/en/company/"}
  ]
})} />
<script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Person",
  "@id": "https://consilegy.com/company/#founder",
  "name": "Seiko Yamaguchi",
  "alternateName": "山口 聖子",
  "jobTitle": "Founder / Revenue Architect",
  "worksFor": { "@id": "https://consilegy.com/#organization" },
  "url": "https://consilegy.com/en/company/",
  "image": "https://consilegy.com/images/common/seiko-yamaguchi-2026b.jpg",
  "knowsLanguage": ["ja", "en"],
  "knowsAbout": ["Revenue Architecture", "RevOps", "Japan GTM", "CRM Implementation", "CRM Product Development", "HubSpot", "Salesforce", "B2B Marketing"],
  "hasCredential": [
    { "@type": "EducationalOccupationalCredential", "name": "HubSpot Marketing Software Certification" },
    { "@type": "EducationalOccupationalCredential", "name": "Google Analytics Certification" },
    { "@type": "EducationalOccupationalCredential", "name": "Shopify Partner Certification" }
  ],
  "sameAs": ["https://seikoyamaguchi.com/", "https://seikoyamaguchi.com/#person", "https://www.linkedin.com/in/seiko-yamaguchi/", "https://www.facebook.com/seikoymgc38", "https://www.instagram.com/hellofromseiko/", "https://note.com/seiko_consilegy", "https://youtrust.jp/users/cf3e8cd0387e45437517b3b6122baea6"]
})} />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="ab-hero">
    <div class="container ab-hero__inner">
      <p class="ab-hero__eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1 class="ab-hero__title">We design strategy, turn it into systems, and stay until it works.</h1>
      <p class="ab-hero__sub">Consilegy builds the revenue architecture, CRM structure, and GTM operations that make Japan execution visible to you and to your HQ. We also build our own product, <a href="/en/crm/">Revenue CRM</a>, officially launched on September 28, 2026.</p>
      <a class="ab-hero__cta" href="/en/contact/">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission -->
  <section class="ab-mission">
    <div class="container ab-mission__inner">
      <p class="ab-hero__eyebrow">Our Mission</p>
      <h2 class="ab-mission__title">Give society <span class="ab-mission__accent">more choices.</span></h2>
      <ul class="ab-mission__tiers">
        <li>Choices change the future.</li>
        <li>Move what you want to do forward.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="ab-mission__body">
        <p>Companies that can't move forward on what they want to do aren't short on ambition. They just can't see which paths are open. Once the structure is visible, choices appear. And when a company chooses and moves forward, new choices open up for its people and its partners too.</p>
        <p>What usually stops a choice is a lack of time and hands. So Consilegy doesn't advise from the outside. We join as part of your team. Your 24 hours, plus ours. <strong>A 48-hour day.</strong> We work alongside you from strategy through implementation and adoption, and we turn what we learn into <a href="/en/crm/">Revenue CRM</a>, a tool we share with more companies.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founder -->
  <section class="ab-founder">
    <div class="container ab-founder__inner">
      <h2 class="ab-section-label">Founder</h2>
      <div class="ab-founder__layout">
        <div class="ab-founder__photo-col">
          <img
            class="ab-founder__photo"
            src="/images/common/seiko-yamaguchi-avatar.jpg"
            alt="Seiko Yamaguchi"
            width="220"
            height="220"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="ab-founder__bio-col">
          <h3 class="ab-founder__name">Seiko Yamaguchi</h3>
          <p class="ab-founder__role">Founder, Consilegy LLC</p>
          <div class="ab-founder__bio">
            <p>Seiko began her career in IT consulting, then built an independent practice in 2015 advising companies across Tokyo on marketing strategy, CRM implementation, and project management. Her client work spanned SaaS, consulting, healthcare, retail, and entertainment, with a consistent focus on Japan-facing and cross-border B2B contexts. She founded Consilegy LLC in 2025 to bring that work together under a dedicated firm for Japan-facing revenue architecture.</p>
            <p>Her work sits between strategy and execution: the GTM structure, revenue architecture, and operating systems that let global teams move effectively in Japan. She holds a PMBOK-based project management background and brings hands-on delivery experience across both market-facing design and CRM/RevOps implementation.</p>
            <p>Bilingual in Japanese and English, she works directly with both sides of global-Japan teams, reducing the friction that typically accumulates when strategy is designed in one language and executed in another.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-founder__creds">
            <p class="ab-founder__creds-label">Certifications</p>
            <ul class="ab-founder__creds-list">
              <li>HubSpot: Marketing Software Certification</li>
              <li>Google: Analytics Individual Qualification (GAIQ) · Ads Search, Display, Video, Shopping, Measurement</li>
              <li>Shopify: Theme Development · Product Fundamentals</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-founder__talks">
            <p class="ab-founder__creds-label">Speaking</p>
            <ul class="ab-founder__talks-list">
              <li><strong>The Complete Masterclass for Japanese Startups (SusHi Tech Tokyo 2026)</strong><br />IdeaBoxes · Apr 2026</li>
              <li><strong>The “Next Action” Workflow: AI + Human Oversight for Lead Response</strong><br />Bizibl Technologies · Apr 2026</li>
              <li><strong>How to Sell Automation (Demo Day)</strong><br />Fukuoka Startup Collective · Oct 2025</li>
              <li><strong>SEO to GEO: Getting Found in the Age of AI Search (Marketing Tuesday)</strong><br />AltSpace Bansko · Jun 2025</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-founder__origin">
            <p class="ab-founder__creds-label">Where Revenue CRM came from</p>
            <p>The product took shape at Hualien Cloud Hub (花蓮雲基地), run by Hualien County. Seiko stayed there with the first cohort, and the shape of this product, CRM and AI together, came out of working alongside founders and remote workers from several countries.</p>
            <p>See News (花蓮視新聞) covered the stay and the build in its 25 June 2026 edition. <a href="https://www.seenews.com.tw/news_data.php?news_id=2325&amp;k_code=A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the article</a></p>
          </div>
          <a class="ab-founder__linkedin" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/seiko-yamaguchi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
            LinkedIn
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container ab-fig-wide" style="margin-block:2rem 2.5rem">
      <figure class="en-fig" aria-labelledby="en-tl-caption">
      	<svg class="fig-pc" viewBox="0 0 1120 205" role="img" aria-label="Founder timeline from age 9 to 36" font-family="inherit">
      		<defs><marker id="en-tl-arr" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="#0F172A"/></marker></defs>
      		<text x="40" y="26" font-size="14" letter-spacing="1.5" fill="#64748b">TIMELINE</text>
      		<line x1="130" y1="120" x2="990" y2="120" stroke="#0F172A" stroke-width="3"/>
      <circle cx="130" cy="120" r="9" fill="#0F172A"/>
      <text x="130" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0F172A"><tspan font-size="14" fill="#64748b">Age </tspan><tspan font-size="22" font-weight="700">9</tspan></text>
      <text x="130" y="160" font-size="16" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">First PC</text><text x="130" y="182" font-size="16" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">from her brother</text>
      <circle cx="302" cy="120" r="9" fill="#0F172A"/>
      <text x="302" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0F172A"><tspan font-size="14" fill="#64748b">Age </tspan><tspan font-size="22" font-weight="700">16</tspan></text>
      <text x="302" y="160" font-size="16" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">Left home,</text><text x="302" y="182" font-size="16" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">supported herself</text>
      <circle cx="474" cy="120" r="9" fill="#0F172A"/>
      <text x="474" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0F172A"><tspan font-size="14" fill="#64748b">Age </tspan><tspan font-size="22" font-weight="700">25</tspan></text>
      <text x="474" y="160" font-size="16" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">Went</text><text x="474" y="182" font-size="16" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">independent</text>
      <circle cx="646" cy="120" r="9" fill="#0F172A"/>
      <text x="646" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0F172A"><tspan font-size="14" fill="#64748b">Age </tspan><tspan font-size="22" font-weight="700">30</tspan></text>
      <text x="646" y="160" font-size="16" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">Moved to</text><text x="646" y="182" font-size="16" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">Taiwan</text>
      <circle cx="818" cy="120" r="9" fill="#0F172A"/>
      <text x="818" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#0F172A"><tspan font-size="14" fill="#64748b">Age </tspan><tspan font-size="22" font-weight="700">35</tspan></text>
      <text x="818" y="160" font-size="16" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">Founded</text><text x="818" y="182" font-size="16" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">Consilegy</text>
      <circle cx="990" cy="120" r="12" fill="#2563EB"/>
      <text x="990" y="80" text-anchor="middle" fill="#2563EB"><tspan font-size="14" fill="#64748b">Age </tspan><tspan font-size="22" font-weight="700">36</tspan></text>
      <text x="990" y="160" font-size="16" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">Released</text><text x="990" y="182" font-size="16" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">Revenue CRM</text>
      	</svg>
<svg class="fig-sp" viewBox="0 0 360 416" role="img" aria-label="Founder timeline from age 9 to 36" font-family="inherit">
			<text x="0" y="22" font-size="14" letter-spacing="1.5" fill="#64748b">TIMELINE</text>
			<line x1="20" y1="56" x2="20" y2="376" stroke="#0F172A" stroke-width="3"/>
			<circle cx="20" cy="56" r="8" fill="#0F172A"/>
			<text x="44" y="63" fill="#0F172A"><tspan font-size="14" fill="#64748b">Age </tspan><tspan font-size="20" font-weight="700">9</tspan></text>
			<text x="124" y="53" font-size="16" fill="#334155">First PC</text>
			<text x="124" y="74" font-size="16" fill="#334155">from her brother</text>
			<circle cx="20" cy="120" r="8" fill="#0F172A"/>
			<text x="44" y="127" fill="#0F172A"><tspan font-size="14" fill="#64748b">Age </tspan><tspan font-size="20" font-weight="700">16</tspan></text>
			<text x="124" y="117" font-size="16" fill="#334155">Left home,</text>
			<text x="124" y="138" font-size="16" fill="#334155">supported herself</text>
			<circle cx="20" cy="184" r="8" fill="#0F172A"/>
			<text x="44" y="191" fill="#0F172A"><tspan font-size="14" fill="#64748b">Age </tspan><tspan font-size="20" font-weight="700">25</tspan></text>
			<text x="124" y="181" font-size="16" fill="#334155">Went</text>
			<text x="124" y="202" font-size="16" fill="#334155">independent</text>
			<circle cx="20" cy="248" r="8" fill="#0F172A"/>
			<text x="44" y="255" fill="#0F172A"><tspan font-size="14" fill="#64748b">Age </tspan><tspan font-size="20" font-weight="700">30</tspan></text>
			<text x="124" y="245" font-size="16" fill="#334155">Moved to</text>
			<text x="124" y="266" font-size="16" fill="#334155">Taiwan</text>
			<circle cx="20" cy="312" r="8" fill="#0F172A"/>
			<text x="44" y="319" fill="#0F172A"><tspan font-size="14" fill="#64748b">Age </tspan><tspan font-size="20" font-weight="700">35</tspan></text>
			<text x="124" y="309" font-size="16" fill="#334155">Founded</text>
			<text x="124" y="330" font-size="16" fill="#334155">Consilegy</text>
			<circle cx="20" cy="376" r="11" fill="#2563EB"/>
			<text x="44" y="383" fill="#2563EB"><tspan font-size="14" fill="#64748b">Age </tspan><tspan font-size="20" font-weight="700">36</tspan></text>
			<text x="124" y="373" font-size="16" fill="#334155">Released</text>
			<text x="124" y="394" font-size="16" fill="#334155">Revenue CRM</text>
			</svg>
      	<figcaption id="en-tl-caption">She didn’t fit the environment she was given, so she built the next one herself. Revenue CRM is where that has led so far.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Consilegy -->
  <section class="ab-why">
    <div class="container ab-why__inner">
      <p class="ab-section-label">Why Consilegy</p>
      <h2 class="ab-section-title">What sets our work apart</h2>
      <ul class="ab-why__list">
        <li class="ab-why__item">
          <strong>Bilingual without interpretation loss</strong>
          <p>We work with you in English and with your Japan team in Japanese, so nothing is diluted between the two sides. For English-speaking leaders managing Japan operations, this is the gap most consultants can't close.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="ab-why__item">
          <strong>Japan operations depth</strong>
          <p>We understand the structural gap between how global revenue systems are designed and how business actually moves in Japan, from trust-building cycles to stakeholder dynamics to CRM adoption patterns.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="ab-why__item">
          <strong>Strategy through implementation</strong>
          <p>We do not stop at recommendations. We connect planning to CRM configuration, workflow design, and launch, and stay until the system works in practice.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="ab-why__item">
          <strong>Disciplined delivery</strong>
          <p>We manage scope, dependencies, and cross-functional execution with PMBOK-grounded discipline, not advisory alone.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="ab-why__item">
          <strong>HubSpot and RevOps experience</strong>
          <p>We support CRM implementation, workflow design, reporting, and adoption with hands-on delivery across Japan-facing engagements.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Track Record -->
  <section class="ab-track">
    <div class="container ab-track__inner">
      <p class="ab-section-label">Track Record</p>
      <h2 class="ab-section-title">Who we have worked with</h2>
      <p class="ab-track__lead">10+ years, 40+ CRM / MA / SFA implementations across SaaS, consulting, healthcare, retail, entertainment, and cross-border B2B.</p>
      <div class="ab-track__grid">
        <div class="ab-track__card">
          <p class="ab-track__cat">Revenue Architecture / CRM / Data Infrastructure</p>
          <div class="ab-track__tags">
            <span class="ab-track__tag">Nishikawa Co., Ltd.</span>
            <span class="ab-track__tag">elife Inc.</span>
            <span class="ab-track__tag">Alibaba Japan</span>
            <span class="ab-track__tag">Kaizen Platform</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-track__card">
          <p class="ab-track__cat">Marketing Strategy / Project Management</p>
          <div class="ab-track__tags">
            <span class="ab-track__tag">Moloco Japan</span>
            <span class="ab-track__tag">MSL Japan</span>
            <span class="ab-track__tag">UCC Ueshima Coffee</span>
            <span class="ab-track__tag">Innova Inc.</span>
            <span class="ab-track__tag">THE MOLTS</span>
            <span class="ab-track__tag">Sazae Pty Ltd</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="ab-track__note">Includes representative engagements by founder Seiko Yamaguchi.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What we believe -->
  <section class="ab-beliefs">
    <div class="container ab-beliefs__inner">
      <p class="ab-section-label">What We Believe</p>
      <h2 class="ab-section-title">How we make decisions</h2>
      <div class="ab-beliefs__grid">
        <div class="ab-belief">
          <strong>Decide with hypotheses and data</strong>
          <p>Measurable assumptions over vague opinions. We build the infrastructure that makes data usable for decisions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-belief">
          <strong>Tie work to outcomes</strong>
          <p>Delivery that doesn't connect to business results isn't finished. We define what success looks like before we start.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-belief">
          <strong>Test small and learn fast</strong>
          <p>Progress through validation is more reliable than overbuilt planning. We prefer reversible steps and clear signals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-belief">
          <strong>Take responsibility for delivery</strong>
          <p>We care about whether the thing actually works, not just whether the work was done. That distinction shapes how we engage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Company Info -->
  <section class="ab-info">
    <div class="container ab-info__inner">
      <p class="ab-section-label">Company</p>
      <h2 class="ab-section-title">Company information</h2>
      <dl class="ab-info__dl">
        <dt>Company name</dt><dd>Consilegy LLC</dd>
        <dt>Founded</dt><dd>May 2025</dd>
        <dt>Location</dt><dd>R-Cube Aoyama 3F, 1-3-1 Kita-Aoyama, Minato-ku, Tokyo 107-0061, Japan</dd>
        <dt>Corporate number</dt><dd>2010403035111</dd>
        <dt>Information security</dt><dd class="company-security"><img src="/images/common/security-action-futatsuboshi-2026.png" alt="SECURITY ACTION: Self-declared information security (two stars)" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy" /><span>Declared SECURITY ACTION two stars with IPA (October 2026) / <a href="/en/security-policy/">Information Security Policy</a></span></dd>
        <dt>Publications</dt><dd><a href="https://media.consilegy.com/en/">B2B Revenue Strategy Journal</a> (by the <a href="https://media.consilegy.com/en/about/">Consilegy Media Editorial Team</a>) / <a href="/en/crm/media/">Revenue CRM Guides</a></dd>
      </dl>
      <p class="ab-profile">
        <a href="/downloads/consilegy-company-profile-en.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download the company profile (PDF)</a>
        <span>Services, results, pricing, and team in 12 slides. Easy to share with HQ.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTA
    title="Managing Japan or APAC revenue as an English-speaking leader?"
    href="/en/contact/"
    label="Get in touch"
  />

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .ab-profile { margin: 1.75rem 0 0; display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .ab-profile a { font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); }
  .ab-profile span { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  /* ── Shared ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-fig-wide { max-width: calc(1120px + 2 * var(--space-md)); }
  .ab-fig-wide figcaption { padding-inline: calc(40 / 1120 * 100%); }
  .ab-section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.6vw, 1.85rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xl);
  }
  .ab-section-label:has(+ .ab-section-title) { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .ab-section-label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xl);
  }

  /* ── Hero ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-hero {
    background: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-block: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .ab-hero__eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .ab-hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .ab-hero__sub {
    font-size: var(--text-lead);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .ab-hero__cta {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.15s;
  }

  .ab-hero__cta:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-dark, #1e3a8a);
  }

  /* ── Mission ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .ab-mission {
    padding-block: var(--space-2xl);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .ab-mission__inner {
    max-width: 760px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ab-mission__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.6vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg);
  }

  .ab-mission__accent {
    color: var(--color-navy);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .ab-mission__tiers {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xl);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 2rem;
  }

  .ab-mission__tiers li {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .ab-mission__body {
    text-align: left;
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .ab-mission__body p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ab-mission__body p + p {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .ab-mission__body strong {
